/* ═══ News share popover (revamp724) — it opened UPWARD, covering the headline
   (the card's identity), and inherited card-inset padding overrides that
   flattened its own padding to 2px. Now it drops BELOW the share button it's
   anchored to, with its own breathing room. ═══════════════════════════════ */
.news-share-panel {
